            text: "For most people, a treadmill, because it handles walking, incline walking and running and needs no skill. But it is not best for everyone: an exercise bike is quieter, smaller and cheaper, a rower works the whole body with no impact, and an elliptical avoids impact with a running-like effort. The best one is the one you will use.",
